							},
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"text": "«QLocalSocket»: a named pipe on Windows, a Unix socket file elsewhere, named trains-train-model (TRAIN_MODEL_LINK overrides it). One test UI at a time; a second one receives {\"op\": \"busy\"}.",
							"left": 862,
							"top": 658,
							"width": 300,
							"height": 80
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGTrM0000000002896=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGTrM0000000002587="
							},
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"text": "Constraints:\n- No network and no external services at runtime.\n- Both processes are on one host; the link is local only.\n- Either process can start first; the test UI reconnects every 1 s.\n- The Test UI process is test scaffolding, removed when the module is integrated (D010).",
							"left": 40,
							"top": 798,
							"width": 520,
							"height": 110
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGTrM0000000002897=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGTrM0000000002587="
							},
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"text": "Workstation: a developer machine (any OS; Ubuntu here). Lab machines run the prebuilt binary instead and need no Python.",
							"left": 600,
							"top": 798,
							"width": 330,
							"height": 55
						},
